说明 / Note

本许可证适用于本仓库中的 Minecraft 数据包实现，即
`datapack/` 目录下的全部文件（`pack.mcmeta` 与 `data/skullcraft/**`）。

「成书标题 + 凋灵骷髅头 → 对应玩家头颅」这一**玩法创意**源自
ruhuasiyu 的 CraftHead（经 zhangshenxing/CraftingPlusPlus 集合仓库分发），
该上游未声明开源许可证，其代码与本仓库**没有代码级复用**。
本仓库的实现是面向 Minecraft 26.3 的重新实现。

The license above applies to the datapack implementation in this repository,
i.e. everything under `datapack/` (`pack.mcmeta` and `data/skullcraft/**`).

The gameplay concept — "written book title + wither skeleton skull ->
matching player head" — originates from CraftHead by ruhuasiyu,
distributed via the zhangshenxing/CraftingPlusPlus collection.
That upstream declares no open-source license, and none of its code is
reused here; this repository is a reimplementation targeting Minecraft 26.3.
